## The fix: tighten model-name truncation

The goal is to let the model name shrink (and ellipsize) earlier so the whole footer stays on one line longer, instead of the model name pushing the mode badge to wrap.

In `src/ui/theme/components/status-bar.css`, on the model-name element (the one inside `.pi-status-main` that holds the model label — e.g. `.pi-status-model` or whatever class `renderStatusBar` emits for it):

